                        3038 --526: /**********************************************************************************************************************
                        3039 --527: **  Function Name   : R_RFD_ShiftToPEMode
                        3040 --528: **  
                        3041 --529: **  - Outline
                        3042 --530: **      Shifts the mode of the target memory of the target FACI to the P/E mode
                        3043 --531: **  - Format
                        3044 --532: **      T_u4_RFDReturn
                        3045 --533: **          R_RFD_ChangeToPEMode(
                        3046 --534: **              T_u2_FACI       i_u2_TargetFACI
                        3047 --535: **              T_en_FACIMode   i_en_FACIMode
                        3048 --536: **          );
                        3049 --537: **  - Input parameter
                        3050 --538: **      i_u2_TargetFACI     : Target FACI to be shifted to the P/E mode
                        3051 --539: **      i_en_FACIMode       : Target flash memory to be shifted to the P/E mode
                        3052 --540: **  - Return
                        3053 --541: **      R_RFD_OK            : Mode has already "i_en_FACIMode" or shift completed
                        3054 --542: **      R_RFD_STS_BUSY      : Set the value of "i_en_FACIMode" to the mode (Not shifted to the mode yet)
                        3055 --543: **      R_RFD_ERR_NOFACI    : Specified FACI is nonexistence
                        3056 --544: **  - Preconditions
                        3057 --545: **      The state of the flash memory must be the READY state
                        3058 --546: **  
                        3059 --547: **  - Traceability          : [Covers:UD_01_120]
                        3060 --548: **********************************************************************************************************************/
